\f0\b \cf0 Key learnings & principles
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Story structure
\f1\b0 : Rich, immersive, 10\'9615 minute read-aloud stories work best. Format: 6\'969 named parts, slow sensory pacing, embedded breathing cues for parent and child, explicit parent guide appended after story\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Therapeutic framing
\f1\b0 : Regulation techniques are embedded in narrative, never clinical. Core repair language separates behavior from identity (e.g., 
\f2\i "my hands did things my heart didn't mean"
\f1\i0 )\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Age calibration
\f1\b0 : Manav has explicitly rejected content that is too dense, scary, or mature for the 3\'964 age range. Stories should be lighter and playful while maintaining emotional impact\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Moral placement
\f1\b0 : Emotional lessons land best when distributed across three progressive moments in the story, culminating in a clear closing line rather than front-loaded messaging\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Spanish removal
\f1\b0 : Manav has at times requested removal of Spanish-language terms of endearment \'97 handle with care; confirm before including\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Cultural elements
\f1\b0 : The universe authentically integrates Spanish, Hindi, and Gujarati, with family references spanning Colombia and India. Code-switching should feel natural, not decorative\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Standalone vs. framed
\f1\b0 : Manav prefers standalone stories without framing devices (e.g., "Mama tells Azi a story") unless explicitly requested\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Illustration aesthetic
\f1\b0 : When illustration prompts are needed, Manav favors raw, authentic child-created-looking art \'97 mixed media, joyful chaos \'97 over polished professional styles\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Approach & patterns
\f1\b0 \
